      "content": "i don't think i want a different narrative though. it's just so exhausting. i've spent every ounce of energy i have just getting to this point, and i feel like there's nothing left in the tank for anything else. what if there's nothing left to even try for? what if the peace i'm looking for isn't in a \"new chapter,\" but just in the total absence of all this noise?",
